  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "地理資訊系統概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO GEOGRAPHIC INFORMATION SYSTEMS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹地理資訊系統（GIS）與空間資訊之理論、應用層面與軟體操作，為GIS基礎課程。理論部分包含空間資訊基本概念、空間資料與屬性資料建立、遙測與GPS應用等。課程使用軟體為ArcGIS，上機內容包括數位圖建立、地圖製作與空間統計分析。",
    "describe_eh": "This entry-level course introduces the basics of GIS and Geo-Spatial information science in the form of lecture and lab. Lectures cover basic concepts, the construction of spatial data and attribute data, remote sensing, and GPS. Lab section provides students with hands-on experience of digital map production and spatial statistical analysis. Software package used in this course is ArcGIS.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
